Sessions: Apache Knowledge Base, Design Patterns in Web Programming (Slides: [RTF](/slides/us-2000/OR080.rtf)), Design Patterns in Web Programming, PHP: Hackers Paradise (Slides: [RTF](/slides/us-2000/OR078.rtf)), PHP: Hackers Paradise, PHP: Hackers Paradise Revisited
